ld be updated in TS38.714. Which version is based on for this TP, such as clause 5.3.1 and 5.3.4, it seems it’s copied originally from 38.104? There’re many wording like “ as the same as BS” or “as the same as UE”, my suggestion is removing them. There should be no misunderstanding if we don’t have these wording.

